      "notes": "Pending owner review; not an approval. Review against assets-source/refs/road_straight (ref-1: 'grass verges with tufts and small bushes'): a small dense round verge bush, 0.88 m tall and 1.19 m across (LOD0), a compact dark box-green mass of numpy-drawn leaf-cluster cards running down to the grass, no stems showing, plant wind data. Built on _shrub.build (shrub_forest's family) through _verge_bush.py. Review sheet: docs/checkpoints/bush_verge/sheet.jpg (ref; textured EEVEE stills beside shrub_forest and a 1.7 m figure; the kit scenario's road tile (0, 0) with three bushes, shrub_forest and a sedan on the lane; play shots with docs/checkpoints/bush_verge/integration.patch applied: play distance, sun and shade close-ups, eye level 1.7 m in walk mode, a van on the road). The controller records the owner's decision."
